type: software
abstract: >-
  Experiment code, raw run logs, behavioural graders and analysis for a study
  measuring what generic guidance in an LLM system prompt costs and what it
  buys, across 198 runs on two OpenAI GPT-5.6 models.
keywords:
  - prompt engineering
  - system prompts
  - large language models
  - LLM applications
  - AI agents
  - evaluation
  - LLMOps
